Multiplying by $m^2$ and using $p^\mu=mu^\mu$, $\boxed{
E^2-\vec p^{\,2}=m^2
}
\qquad(c=1).$ Equivalently, $E=\sqrt{\vec p^{\,2}+m^2}.$

